ad nightmares about the event(s) or thought about event(s) when you did not want to?","_display":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Avez-vous fait des cauchemars sur l'événement (les événements) ou y avez-vous pensé alors que vous ne le vouliez pas ?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"هل راودتك كوابيس حول الحدث (الأحداث) أو فكرت في الحدث (الأحداث) عندما لم ترغب في ذلك؟"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Снились ли вам кошмары о событии(ях) или вы думали о событии(ях), когда не хотели?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"¿Tuvo pesadillas sobre el(los) evento(s) o pensó en el(los) evento(s) cuando no quería?"}]}]}}}]}]},{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-itemExtractionContext","valueExpression":{"name":"q2","language":"application/x-fhir-query","expression":"Observation"}}],"linkId":"q2-group","type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"q2-inner-group","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.valueCodeableConcept","type":"group","item":[{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control","code":"radio-button","display":"Radio Button"}]}},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression","valueExpression":{"language":"text/fhirpath","expression":"%observations.entry.resource.ofType(Observation).where(code.coding.code = '4cd3f7cc-9974-4496-9503-78ab84a4a844').value.coding.first()"}},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-choiceOrientation","valueCode":"horizontal"}],"linkId":"q2","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.valueCodeableConcept.coding","prefix":"2. ","text":"Tried hard not to think about the event(s) oe went out way to avoid situations that reminded you of the event(s)?","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Avez-vous fait de gros efforts pour ne pas penser à l'événement (aux événements) ou avez-vous fait des détours pour éviter les situations qui vous rappelaient l'événement (les événements) ?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"هل حاولت جاهداً عدم التفكير في الحدث (الأحداث) أو بذلت جهداً لتجنب المواقف التي تذكرك بالحدث (الأحداث)؟"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Старались ли вы не думать о событии(ях) или изо всех сил избегали ситуаций, которые напоминали вам о событии(ях)?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"¿Se esforzó por no pensar en el(los) evento(s) o hizo lo posible por evitar situaciones que le recordaran el(los) evento(s)?"}]}]},"type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"code":"1065AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA","display":"Yes","_display":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Oui"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"نعم"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valu